9,"ingredientId":296933,"name":"Salt","category":"mineral","ingredientGroup":"Salt (unspecified)","uniiCode":"451W47IQ8X","alternateNames":[],"forms":[]},{"order":20,"ingredientId":280319,"name":"Silicon Dioxide","category":"mineral","ingredientGroup":"Silicon","uniiCode":"ETJ7Z6XBU4","alternateNames":["SiO2"],"forms":[]},{"order":21,"ingredientId":3794,"name":"Sucralose","category":"non-nutrient/non-botanical","ingredientGroup":"Sucralose","uniiCode":null,"alternateNames":[],"forms":[]},{"order":22,"ingredientId":286379,"name":"Sunflower Lecithin","category":"fat","ingredientGroup":"lecithin","uniiCode":"834K0WOS5G","alternateNames":[],"forms":[]}]},"pdf":"317632_document.pdf","percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.","physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"productVersionCode":"CODE 012352 GYG","servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":55,"maxQuantity":55,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":2,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"2 scoops","inSFB":true}],"servingsPerContainer":"25","src":"api/label/317632","statements":[{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"30% increase in muscle strength in just 8 weeks\nAn 8-week, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 33 healthy men compared the effectiveness of this proprietary module of whey protein and leucine vs. an isocaloric carbohydrate placebo consumed before and after resistance training. Subjects consuming the leucine-whey protein supplement experienced greater increases in muscle strength than those on the placebo. Leucine-whey protein supplementation also increased muscle cross-sectional area from baseline."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"In an 8-week, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 30 healthy male volunteers comparing 1 set resistance training (RT) + active or carbohydrate placebo to 2 sets RT alone with no supplement, the active group showed equal gains in maximal muscle strength and muscle endurance compared to the control group."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Notice: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Product sold by weight, not volume. Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Amylopectin (Waxy Maize) Chromium Complex as Velositol.\r\nVelositol and its associated logo is a trademark of nutrition 21, LLC. Velositol is patent protected."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Informed\r\nWe Test - You Trust\r\nChoice regularly tested for banned substances"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Products bearing this logo have been tested for banned substances by LGC Science, Inc., a world-class anti-doping lab. Product was tested for over 285 banned substances on the 2023 World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) Prohibited List via LGC skip lot testing protocol #ICP0307."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Proven to increase muscle strength and size in just 8 weeks\r\nIn an 8-week, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 39 healthy male volunteers comparing 1 set resistance training (RT) + active or carbohydrate placebo to 2 sets RT alone with no supplement, the active group showed equal gains in maximal muscle strength and muscle endurance compared to the control group."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Ultra-Pure, fast digesting whey protein isolate & hydrolysates\r\nClinically proven performance protein\r\n40g Protein\r\n15g EAA\r\nEAA = essential amino acids\r\n6.2g Leucine\r\n500mg Velositol\r\nPer 2 Scoops\r\nCafe Latte\r\nNatural + artificial flavors"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: As a dietary supplement, consume 2 scoops in 8 fl.oz. of cold water or your favorite beverage. Wheybolic can be consumed first thing in the morning, pre-workout and/or post-workout. For maximum results, reference usage benefits and consume 2 scoops twice daily."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Servings per container 50 25"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Milk."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Warning: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Contains a bioengineered food ingredient.\r\nWarning: Cancer and Reproductive Harm - ww.P65Warnings.ca.gov.\r\nDiscontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Gluten free.\r\nGf Gluten free\r\nBanned Substance Tested"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Banned Substance Tested"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Superior performance protein\r\nEnhanced with more leucine than standard whey protein\r\nElevated muscle fuel for muscle growth & recovery\r\nWhen used in conjunction with an exercise program.\r\nFeatures only premium, ultra-pure, fast-digesting protein\r\nOnly whey hydrolysates and a clinical core of whey isolate and leucine to improve strength\r\nAn 8-week, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 33 healthy men compared the effectiveness of this proprietary module of whey protein and leucine vs. an isocaloric carbohydrate placebo consumed before and after resistance training. Subjects consuming the leucine-whey protein supplement experienced greater increases in muscle strength than those on the placebo. Leucine-whey protein supplementation also increased muscle cross-sectional area from baseline.\r\nEnhanced with velositol & leucine to accelerate muscle protein synthesis\r\nWhen used in conjunction with an exercise program."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Usage Benefits\r\nFor pre-workout & cardio\r\nClinically proven support for strength, performance & stamina\r\nAn 8-week, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 33 healthy men compared the effectiveness of this proprietary module of whey protein and leucine vs. an isocaloric carbohydrate placebo consumed before and after resistance training. Subjects consuming the leucine-whey protein supplement experienced greater increases in muscle strength than those on the placebo. Leucine-whey protein supplementation also increased muscle cross-sectional area from baseline.\r\nIn an 8-week, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 39 healthy male volunteers comparing 1 set resistance training (RT) + active or carbohydrate placebo to 2 sets RT alone with no supplement, the active group showed equal gains in maximal muscle strength and muscle endurance compared to the control group."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"For post-workout & cardio\r\nProvides fast-digesting whey isolate & hydrolysates plus Leucine to fuel muscle and support recovery\r\nOn non-training days & between meals\r\nProvides high-quality protein & critical amino acids to fuel muscles while you recover from intense training\r\nWhen used in conjunction with an exercise program."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"If it's on our labels, then it's in our bottles. Full dosing, full transparency and no proprietary blends. Clinically studied ingredients backed by real science. The most effective and premium performance protein available. Train harder."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"This statement has not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Gluten Free"],"thumbnail":"317632_thumbnail.jpg","upcSku":"0 48107 21393 0","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}